# Mock development examples. Create a NEW key in API & Webhooks and paste its
# one-time token below. Select numbers:read, messages:read and billing:read.
# Seeded key rows illustrate statuses; their random plaintext tokens are discarded.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@organizationId = d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@apiKey = PASTE_YOUR_NEW_DEVELOPMENT_KEY

### Leased Mock numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/workspace?view=numbers&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Message metadata (body requires the detail request below)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/workspace?view=messages&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Wallet and ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/workspace?view=ledger&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Completed Mock orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/workspace?view=orders&status=completed&limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Decrypt one message; use an id from the metadata response
@messageId = PASTE_MESSAGE_ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
